param.para:
The final character before the null character must be a backslash ('\'). If you do not specify the backslash, it will be added
for you; therefore, specify MAX_PATH-2 characters for the path unless you include the trailing backslash, in which case,
specify MAX_PATH-1 characters for the path.

remarks.para:
